litás,OE szám,alkatrészkereső,AutoFit AI\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-ink-950 font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"relative flex min-h-screen flex-col\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-radial-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-grid bg-grid-fade opacity-[0.35]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-ink-950/40 backdrop-blur-sm\"><nav class=\"container-page flex h-16 items-center justify-between gap-4\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-none\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">AutoFit<span class=\"text-brand-500\"> AI</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-graphite-500\">Parts Compatibility</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 lg:flex\"><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/\">Főoldal</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Kompatibilitás</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Alkatrészek</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/garazs\">Garázs</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/utitervek\">Útiterv</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 lg:flex\"><a class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-300 transition-colors hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:text-white\" aria-label=\"Alkatrészkereső\" href=\"/alkatreszek\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"/bejelentkezes\">Bejelentkezés</a><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-200 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menü\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container-page py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>A projektről</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">Az AutoFit AI bemutatása</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Modern, prémium autóipari megjelenésű platform, amely az alkatrész-kompatibilitás ellenőrzését teszi egyszerűvé és átláthatóvá.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]\"><div class=\"card p-6 sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-xl font-bold text-white\">Miért készült ez a projekt?</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-300\">Az alkatrészvásárlás gyakran bizonytalansággal jár: vajon a kiválasztott fékbetét vagy szűrő tényleg illik a járműhöz? Az AutoFit AI ezt a folyamatot rendszerezi. A felhasználó kiválasztja az autót és megadja az alkatrészt, a rendszer pedig érthető eredményt ad – indoklással, figyelmeztetésekkel és bizonyossági szinttel.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-300\">Az adatok egy valós PostgreSQL (Supabase) adatbázisban tárolódnak: a jármű-katalógus, az alkatrészek, az OE számok és a kompatibilitási rekordok mind onnan származnak. A bejelentkezés valós Supabase Auth-tal működik, a mentett autók, kedvencek és ellenőrzések pedig a felhasználói fiókhoz kötődnek.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.07] px-4 py-3\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-300\">i</span><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-emerald-100/90 sm:text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-200\">Valós adatbázis.</strong> Az alkatrész-, jármű- és kompatibilitási adatok a csatlakoztatott Supabase (PostgreSQL) adatbázisból származnak. A kompatibilitást kizárólag a <span class=\"font-mono\">fitments</span> tábla rekordjai döntik el – a rendszer nem talál ki adatot.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-900/40 p-4\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Modern architektúra</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind, komponensalapú felépítés.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-900/40 p-4\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-4 w-4\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Valós adatbázis</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Supabase (PostgreSQL): járművek, alkatrészek, fitmentek, felhasználói adatok.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-900/40 p-4\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Átláthatóság</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Minden kompatibilitási eredmény az adatbázis fitments rekordjain alapul.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-900/40 p-4\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Felhasználó-központú</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Garázs, mentett ellenőrzések és kedvencek a saját fiókban.</p></div></div></div><aside class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"card p-5\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 h-4 w-4 text-brand-400\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg>Projekt tények</h3><dl class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">Név</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">AutoFit AI</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">Verzió</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">2.0 – adatbázis</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">Stack</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">Next.js · TypeScript · Tailwind</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">Adattárolás</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">Supabase (PostgreSQL)</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">Hitelesítés</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">Supabase Auth</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-ink-800 pb-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0\"><dt class=\"text-graphite-500\">AI integráció</dt><dd class=\"text-right font-medium text-graphite-100\">Tervezett</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"card p-5\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4 text-brand-400\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>Következő lépések</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">A hosszú távú cél egy valós adatbázisra és AI szolgáltatásokra épülő platform, kép alapú alkatrész felismeréssel, VIN alapú azonosítással és 3D konfigurátorral.</p><a class=\"btn-ghost mt-4 w-full\" href=\"/utitervek\">Teljes útiterv<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></aside></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-20 border-t border-ink-800 bg-ink-950\"><div class=\"container-page py-14\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-none\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">AutoFit<span class=\"text-brand-500\"> AI</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-graphite-500\">Parts Compatibility</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Modern autóalkatrész-kompatibilitási platform. Találd meg a jár